        "payload": "tree eb665c105e177855787c97d34363433ab82214b1\nparent fcf76ea549f8b6124ffd52526565cf736033b9be\nauthor Jameson Lopp <jameson.lopp@gmail.com> 1794142479 -0500\ncommitter Jameson Lopp <jameson.lopp@gmail.com> 1794162640 -0500\n\nvalidation: reduce per-transaction work\n\nDuplicate input check (CheckTransaction): replace the std::set with a\npairwise scan for transactions up to 96 inputs. 2X to 3X speedup.\n\nRelative lock times (EvaluateSequenceLocks): CalculateSequenceLocks\nreturns {-1,-1} when no input has an active relative lock, so consult the\nprevious block's median time past only when lockPair.second >= 0. Avoids\nan 11-entry walk plus sort for the large majority of transactions.\n\nConnectBlock: skip the per-input coin lookups that fill prevheights when\nBIP68 is not enforced for the block, the tx version is below 2, or every\ninput sets SEQUENCE_LOCKTIME_DISABLE_FLAG. Correct because none of those\ncases can read a height.\n\nSigop cost (GetTransactionSigOpCost): fold the P2SH and witness counts\ninto one pass over the inputs, halving coin cache lookups for P2SH txs.\n",
